@prefix orexis: <http://example.org/orexis#> .
@prefix mqtt4ssn: <https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

<> a orexis:OntologyGraph .    # this document is one graph, and this is what it is

#  OREXIS MQTT TRANSPORT, AGENT 0.2.0.
#  The MQTT transport of Agent 0.2.0 declares no word of its own: it speaks MQTT4SSN, the ontology
#  that extends SSN and SOSA with the MQTT protocol in the OASIS specification's terms, and these
#  are the terms it reads. A sensor observesTopic the Topic it publishes on,
#  a board that takes commands listensToTopic another, a TopicFilter matchesTopic a Topic and
#  carries its hasFilterPattern — the one place a topic's name is said, since MQTT4SSN names a
#  topic through the filters that match it and a topic name is itself a valid filter — and a
#  Client, board or agent, isConnectedToBroker a Broker. The broker's address is a deployment fact,
#  stated in a graph of a kind no agent loads, and is never read off the world. The adoption is by prefix: this file names MQTT4SSN's namespace
#  and speaks its words, and the vendored copy the tests read is
#  tests/fixtures/vocabularies/mqtt4ssn.ttl.
#
#  A TRANSPORT IS NO ROLE, so it declares none: it is loaded where a loaded role needs bytes and the
#  society wires a bus (agent/runtime.py, `TRANSPORTS`). What it ships is the one need a role states
#  in this transport's words — a SPEAKER HEARS ON A TOPIC IT LISTENS TO — since speech, beneath the
#  transport, speaks none of them; `orexis-onboard` refuses a speaker whose world names no topic it
#  listens to, as it refuses a topic an agent listens to that no speaker hears
#  (a-package-is-loaded-only-for-a-role-the-agent-is-declared-in).

@prefix sh: <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#> .
@prefix speech: <http://example.org/orexis/speech#> .

[] a sh:NodeShape ;
    sh:targetClass speech:Speaker ;
    sh:sparql [ a sh:SPARQLConstraint ;
        sh:message "a speaker listens to no topic: no peer's document would reach it" ;
        sh:select """SELECT ?me WHERE { ?me a orexis:Self FILTER NOT EXISTS { ?me mqtt4ssn:listensToTopic ?topic } }""" ] .
